{
  "source": "EBOOT.BIN/battle_tutorial",
  "strings": [
    {
      "text": "The character will move in the",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "direction of  the analog stick.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "~ button while you point",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "the analog stick to run.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 24
    },
    {
      "text": " when next to a person   ",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "or an item to talk or examine.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "You can have up to three Digimon",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "in your party during battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "Normal Attack: Use the left or right arrow keys",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 47
    },
    {
      "text": "to select if there is more than one enemy.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "Skill: Use SP to perform a powerful skill.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "The effects and SP cost depend on the skill.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Guard: Weakens damage sustained from",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "enemies. This will last until the next turn.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Item: Uses an item on hand. Items have",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "various effects such as support and healing.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "Run: Allows you to run from battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 35
    },
    {
      "text": "However, you may end up taking attacks.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "Strategy: Allows you to change the",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "strategy of your ally Digimon.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "The Timeline will be in the",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "lower area during battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "The Timeline indicates all of the Digimon",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "who are participating in the battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "The icons move to the left, and a Digimon",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "will act when their icon hits the edge.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Digimon has acted,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "their icon will return to the right.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "Powerful skills push the icon away further,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "delaying the Digimon's next turn.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "While attacking, you'll encounter the",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "Shock and Break effects.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Shock causes the icon of the",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "affected Digimon to stop moving.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Break returns the icon of the",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "affected Digimon to the right.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "After clearing Episode, you'll return",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "to the Episode Selection screen.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Here, you can select an Episode to play next,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 45
    },
    {
      "text": "or change your party member strategy.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "However, you can't play another Episode",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "until you finish the one in progress.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "On the Episode Selection screen,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "press the SELECT button to save.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": " button to see the main menu where",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "you can use items and arrange equipment.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 40
    },
    {
      "text": "By equipping obtained DigiPieces, your",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "Digimon will become stronger.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "DigiPieces can raise stats, add",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "new skills, or have other effects.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose a DigiPiece to equip and",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "place it in the central Skill Panel.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot place two equipped",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "DigiPieces so that they overlap.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the ",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 10
    },
    {
      "text": " button to remove a DigiPiece.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "The Skill Panel shape varies by Digimon.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 40
    },
    {
      "text": "You have limited space to fit the pieces.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Digimon reaches a certain",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "level, their Skill Panel will grow.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 35
    },
    {
      "text": "You can synthesize a new DigiPiece",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "by collecting necessary materials.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "You can also obtain materials by",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "breaking down unwanted DigiPieces.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "You can also make items",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "from the same materials.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "During the game, conversations between ",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "characters may deepen their bonds.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the Bonding Rank, and",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "higher ranks will affect battles.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "If the Digimon of a character with a high ",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonding Rank will be acting next,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "a powerful Bonding Combo support",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "attack may be triggered.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "The higher the rank, the higher",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "the chance of a Bonding Combo.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "You can check the status of your Bonding",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 40
    },
    {
      "text": "Rank in the status menu at any time.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "As the story progresses, the Digimon",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "will become able to evolve.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "Evolution costs SP but stats will rise",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "and the Digimon will be stronger.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "Status effects such as lowered stats",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "or  poison will be removed.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "The skillset will also change to have",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "more powerful but SP-costly skills.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 35
    },
    {
      "text": "There are two types of Episodes,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "Main and Sub-Episodes.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "A Sub-Episode with a yellow icon",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "indicates limited time left to play it.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "Continuing with a Main Episode will",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 35
    },
    {
      "text": "cause the Sub-Episode to disappear.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 35
    },
    {
      "text": "Press left or right at the",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "Episode Selection menu...",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "...to switch the type displayed",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "between All, Main, or Sub.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "From the Episode Selection screen,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "you can challenge the Digital Dungeon.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the L or R button at the Episode Selection",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 48
    },
    {
      "text": "screen to switch to Dungeon Selection.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "The enemies vary by dungeon level and type.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a good place to earn EXP and items.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "The goal will move you to the next level.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 41
    },
    {
      "text": " at the starting point marked EXIT",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "to return to the Episode Selection screen.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "New dungeons will be added during the story",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "progress with stronger enemies within.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 38
    },
    {
      "text": "You have cleared all of the Main Episodes!",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "If you load the save data created after clearing",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 48
    },
    {
      "text": "the game, you can start a New Game+.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "You will retain your levels from your cleared",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 45
    },
    {
      "text": "game, along with your evolutions.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "Skill Panel size, obtained DigiPieces, items,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 45
    },
    {
      "text": "materials, and recipes will also be retained.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 45
    },
    {
      "text": "The last Digital Dungeon will also be",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "added to the Dungeon Selection.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be very strong enemies here,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 39
    },
    {
      "text": "but you can find even more valuable items.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 42
    },
    {
      "text": "During a New Game+, you can evolve",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 34
    },
    {
      "text": "to Omegamon during battle.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "When you have both WarGreymon &",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "MetalGarurumon in your party during battle,",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 43
    },
    {
      "text": "select Omegamon from the Evolve menu",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "to fuse them into ultra-powerful Omegamon.",
      "translation": "",
      "_length": 42
    },
